  "result": "Perfect! Added `addLine()` and `removeLine()` to src/invoices.js:\n\n**addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })** \u2014 Adds a line to a draft invoice, or increases qty if that SKU already exists. Validates qty and SKU with the same error codes as createInvoice, plus NOT_DRAFT.\n\n**removeLine(invoice, sku)** \u2014 Removes a line from a draft invoice by SKU. Returns:\n- fail('NOT_DRAFT') if invoice isn't draft\n- fail('LINE_NOT_FOUND') if SKU isn't on invoice\n- fail('NO_LINES') if it's the last line\n- ok(newInvoice) otherwise\n\nAdded 3 new error codes (NOT_DRAFT, LINE_NOT_FOUND) and 12 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Adding new lines and updating existing ones\n- Validation errors (qty, SKU, non-draft status)\n- Removing lines and edge cases\n- Non-mutation of input\n- Chaining operations together\n\nAll 40 tests pass.",
